# Safety Rules

Never run without explicit authorization:

- live Capital.com submission or real-money enablement;
- destructive SQL or production migrations;
- `git reset --hard` or `git clean -fdx`;
- deletion of model artifacts or datasets;
- wholesale rewrites of `pipeline.py`, `storage.py`, or `capital_execution.py`;
- edits to `vendor/Kronos`.

Never commit `.env`, credentials, tokens, raw DSNs, runtime databases, broker sessions, model weights/caches, sensitive execution exports, or transient AI-tool locks.

Before finishing, inspect the diff; report changed files, tests, skipped verification, and whether runtime trading behavior changed.
